Blood-raining cloud drenches marching demon host --- Horses stumble while vulture grips golden flagstaff --- Jackals howl and darkness swallows all quarters --- Sun seized eclipseless while stars rise by day --- Khara laughs off omens and boasts matchless strength --- Khara vows to kill Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa with arrows --- Sages gather praying victory for Rāghava over Paulastyas --- Twelve heroes flank Khara while four trail Dūṣaṇa